%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'fontFamily': 'serif', 'primaryColor': '#ffffff', 'edgeLabelBackground': '#ffffff'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ROS as ROS 2 Context
    participant Node as MpcNode
    participant Ctrl as MpcController
    participant Model as VehicleModel
    participant Solv as SolverInterface (OSQP)

    Note over ROS, Solv: Control Cycle (Triggered at horizon.control_rate_hz)
    ROS->>Node: Timer Callback
    
    Node->>Node: Fetch latest Odometry (state x<sub>0</sub>)
    Node->>Node: Fetch Track Waypoints (reference)
    
    Note right of Node: Compute Adaptive Prediction Step
    Node->>Node: dt = clamp(L / (N * v), dt_min, dt_max)
    
    Node->>Ctrl: computeOptimalCommand(state, reference, dt)
    activate Ctrl

    loop Over Prediction Horizon N
        Ctrl->>Model: computeDiscreteLinearization(x_ref, u_ref, dt)
        activate Model
        Note right of Model: RK4 Integration +<br/>Finite Difference Jacobians
        Model-->>Ctrl: A<sub>d</sub>, B<sub>d</sub>, c
        deactivate Model
        
        Ctrl->>Ctrl: Build State Cost (Q) & Input Cost (R, R_rate)
        Note right of Ctrl: Map path-relative errors (e<sub>y</sub>, e<sub>ψ</sub>)<br/>into full state cost P, q
    end

    Ctrl->>Solv: buildAndSolveQP()
    activate Solv
    Note right of Solv: min ½ z<sup>T</sup> P z + q<sup>T</sup> z<br/>s.t. l ≤ A z ≤ u
    Solv->>Solv: Run ADMM (OSQP)
    Solv-->>Ctrl: Optimal solution z<sup>*</sup> = [x<sub>0</sub>..x<sub>N</sub>, u<sub>0</sub>..u<sub>N-1</sub>]
    deactivate Solv

    Ctrl-->>Node: Solution status, cost, and command u<sub>0</sub><sup>*</sup>
    deactivate Ctrl

    alt Solve Successful
        Node->>ROS: Publish AckermannDrive to /mpc/drive_cmd
        Node->>ROS: Publish predicted horizon to /mpc/predicted_path
    else Solver Failed / Stale Data
        Note over Node, ROS: Apply fallback policy<br/>(hold_last, zero_command, brake)
        Node->>ROS: Publish fallback AckermannDrive
    end
    Node->>ROS: Publish diagnostic /mpc/status
